WEBVTT

00:04:29.820 --> 00:04:31.730
gaan ek alles terug skenk.

00:04:31.730 --> 00:04:34.840
Die les wat ek myself 
hierdie week probeer leer

00:04:34.840 --> 00:04:37.000
is dat dit oukei is om dinge te laat gaan.

00:04:37.000 --> 00:04:39.780
Ek hoef nie te geheg 
aan die goed te raak nie:

00:04:39.780 --> 00:04:41.770
iewers om die draai

00:04:41.770 --> 00:04:43.470
sal daar altyd

00:04:43.470 --> 00:04:45.930
nog ’n kleurvolle, maltrap

00:04:45.930 --> 00:04:47.550
blink uitrusting wees

00:04:47.550 --> 00:04:49.000
wat net vir my wag,

00:04:49.000 --> 00:04:52.360
as ek net met ’n bietjie liefde 
in my hart daarvoor soek.

00:04:52.360 --> 00:04:54.160
Baie dankie.

00:04:54.160 --> 00:04:57.300
(Applous)

00:04:57.300 --> 00:04:59.030
Baie dankie.

00:04:59.030 --> 00:05:01.490
(Applous)